</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Serological evidence of peste des petits ruminants in Jordan</article-title><source>Vet Rec</source><year>1991</year><volume>128</volume><fpage>110</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2024417</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ozkul</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Akca</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Alkan</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Barrett</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Karaoglu</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Dagalp</surname><given-names>SB</given-names></name><name><surname>Anderson</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Yesilbag</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Cokcaliskan</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Gensay</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Burgu</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Prevalence, distribution, and host range of Peste des petits ruminants virus, Turkey</article-title><source>Emerg Infect Dis</source><year>2002</year><volume>8</volume><fpage>708</fpage><lpage>712</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12095439</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Singh</surname><given-names>RP</given-names></name><name><surname>Saravanan</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Sreenivasa</surname><given-names>BP</given-names></name><name><surname>Singh</surname><given-names>RK</given-names></name><name><surname>Bandyopadhyay</surname><given-names>SK</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Prevalence and distribution of peste des petits ruminants (PPR) virus infection in small ruminants of India</article-title><source>Rev sci tech Off int